      "description": "<p>Now you can enjoy your favourite STARBUCKS café flavour in the comfort of your own home with STARBUCKS Almond & Oat Non-Dairy Pumpkin Spice Latte Coffee Enhancer (828 ml). Inspired by STARBUCKS classic and delicious Pumpkin Spice Latte, we crafted a smooth blend of almond and oat along with delicious flavours of pumpkin, cinnamon and nutmeg to pair with our coffee for a perfect taste of fall. Add this STARBUCKS enhancer to hot or iced coffee drinks as a non-dairy alternative to creamer or half and half. Simply shake well before use to elevate your cup of coffee!</p><ul><li>Flavoured coffee enhancer with a smooth blend of almond and oat, and delicious flavours of pumpkin, cinnamon and nutmeg to pair with our coffee for a perfect taste of fall</li><li>STARBUCKS Almond & Oat Non-Dairy Pumpkin Spice Latte Coffee Enhancer (828 ml) is a delightful non-dairy alternative to milk, creamer or half-and-half</li><li>Delicious in hot and cold coffee drinks with a perfectly smooth and balanced taste that pairs well with your favourite STARBUCKS roast</li><li>Only 30 calories per tablespoon (15 ml)</li><li>Proudly prepared in Canada with no artificial colours & flavours</li></ul>",
